● The value of sumParams.inner*sizeof(T) must be an integer
multiple of 32 bytes.
● sumParams.inner is the value obtained by converting the
sumParams.n byte size and padding it up to the nearest 32-
aligned integer, where inner = (n × sizeof(T) + 32 – 1) / 32 × 32 /
