completed in one repeat. The process is as follows:
a. Add data0 and data1 to obtain data00, add data2 and data3 to obtain
data01, ..., add data124 and data125 to obtain data62, and add data126
and data127 to obtain data63.
b. Add data00 and data01 to obtain data000, add data02 and data03 to
obtain data001, ..., and add data62 and data63 to obtain data031.
c. By analogy, the destination operand is one piece of float16 data, denoted
as [data].

